<% provide(:title, 'Sell with Rhombus') %>

<%= content_for :head do %>
  <%#= stylesheet_link_tag "style_home.css", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
  <%#= stylesheet_link_tag "responsive_home.css", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
  <%#= stylesheet_link_tag "custom_home.css", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag "mainly_static_pages", "data-turbolinks-track" => true %>
<% end %>

<body>

	<div class="main-wrapper">
		<%= render 'shared/header' %>

		<div class="image">
      	<img src="/assets/sellwithrhombus.jpg" alt="img-responsive" style="height: 600px" width="100%"/>
         <h2><span>Sell More With Friction-Free Payments.<span class='spacer'></span><br /><span class='spacer'></span><span class="tagline2"></span></span>
         <p><a href="/signup" class="btn btn-danger prompt_button">GET A FREE RHOMBUS NUMBER</a></p>
         </h2>
		</div>
	

	

<div class="section white ha-waypoint" >
		<div class="container">
		<div class="p-t-60">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">SIMPLE PAYMENTS</h4>
			<p>
			No app downloads required. Rhombus takes the hassle out of buying, making it simpler than ever for your customers to pay you via SMS.  All transactions are billed directly to your customers debit card or bank account. No carrier billing.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">QUICK CUSTOMER SIGNUP</h4>
			<p>
			To start paying with Rhombus, your customers simply text “signup” to your rhombus number, and follow a signup link on their phones to create an account. In 2 minutes, they’ll be ready to make their first of many payments.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">SECURE TRANSACTIONS</h4>
			<p>
			Paying with rhombus is safer than debit cards or checks.  We encrypt and tokenize your customers’ payment information so no one can have access to it. 
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

				<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">REAL-TIME DASHBOARD</h4>
			<p>
		Monitor your transactions as they come in with the Rhombus real-time dashboard. We’ve made it incredibly easy to keep an eye on your bottom line by showing you every customer debits, credits to your account and refund requests from your customers. 
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">ONE DAY PAYOUT SCHEDULE</h4>
			<p>
		The payments you receive via Rhombus are deposited to your bank account the next business day. This applies to all payments taken during normal business hours (before 5pm PT); the funds will be deposited into your bank account the next business day. Payments processed after 5pm PT will be deposited into your bank account by the second business day.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">CONVENIENT</h4>
			<p>
	Give your customers more ways to pay you. No more debit or credit card forms. No more checks. No more calling out sensitive payment information over the phone. By far the fastest checkout experience for your customers
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

		<div class="col-md-12 feature-list pricing">
			Simple pricing, just 2% per transaction + card processing fees (2.9% + $0.30) to receive payments. Please contact us for volume pricing.
		<div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

		</div>
		<br>
		</div>
	  </div>
	</div>




<div class="section grey">
	<div class="container">
	  <div class="p-t-40 p-b-50 ">

		<div class="row feature-list value_prop">	
		<h3 class="title">Two more great reasons to offer rhombus:</h3>	
 	     	<div>
			<h4>Grow your sales & profit </h4>
Offering Rhombus to your customers limits checkout abandonment, which translates into higher sales and profits for your business. We offer the safest and simplest way for your customers to pay instantly with no added cost to you. Your Rhombus number is free, and there are no monthly costs. Start accepting payments via SMS in 5 minutes. Risk free.

<h4>Easy to integrate</h4>
It’s never been easier to integrate a mobile payment option into your business. Simply complete the signup form to get your free Rhombus number, and in 5 minutes you’ll be on your way to offering the most ubiquitous payment option to your customers. Include your Rhombus number in marketing materials, so your customers can start paying faster immediately.
			</div>

		</div>
	</div>
</div>	

<div class="section table-layout">	
			<div id="working-section" class="table-cell v-middle">	
				<div >
				<h3 class="text-white text-center custom-font no-margin">JOIN A GROWING LIST OF BUSINESSES USING RHOMBUS</h3>
				</div>
			</div>
</div>


<%= render "shared/call_to_action" %>

<%= render "shared/footer" %>


</body>